d}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (序数类, 集合论标准符号)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> is the metatheoretic satisfaction relation, applicable to the proper-class structure <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(V,\\in)\">\\((V,\\in)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\left(\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\land\\forall\\vec a\\in V_\\alpha^n\\;\\bigl((V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow(V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\bigr)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}reflection} \\vdash \\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\left(\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\land\\forall\\vec a\\in V_\\alpha^n\\;\\bigl((V_\\alpha,\\in\\cap(V_\\alpha\\times V_\\alpha))\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow(V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\bigr)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the one-formula instance of the finite reflection scheme; conjunction gives the corresponding statement for any finite family of formulas.</li>\n<li>Satisfaction for the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> is metatheoretic, not an application of the set-coded satisfaction predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-thm-reflection.md","status":"resolved","id":"dea0e944a5a296c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 